{"seq":3,"slug":"masterdata-import-validation-and-exceptions","title":"主数据导入校验与异常处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-channel-price-list-administration/price-list-masterdata/masterdata-import-validation-and-exceptions","wordCount":2600,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"主数据导入校验与异常处理\">主数据导入校验与异常处理</h1><p>价目表上线的那一刻，系统拿到的不是一条条手工录入的记录，而是供应商发来的 CSV、渠道商推送的 API 批量、ERP 导出的价格快照。这些来源里的每一个都可能把 <code>12.999</code> 写进只有两位小数的日元栏，把失效的 GTIN 塞进商品键，或者在同一渠道同一时段挂上两条互相冲突的售价。导入校验要做的，是在这些数据进入价格主表<strong>之前</strong>把它们拦住、分类并给出可处置的解释——而不是等到结算时才发现收错了钱。</p>\n<p>本篇处理&quot;数据怎么进来、坏了怎么办&quot;的问题。同章 <a href=\"price-list-types-and-price-elements\">价目表类型与价格要素</a> 定义主数据有哪些要素、<a href=\"multi-currency-and-uom-price-conversion\">多币种与计量单位价格换算</a> 定义币种与单位如何换算，本篇假定模型已定，专注入口的守门与异常闭环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>价格主数据导入是一次<strong>批量写入</strong>，它和单条录入的根本区别在于失败的粒度。单条录入失败了就重填；批量导入里一条错行不应该让其余十万行一起回滚，但也不能悄悄跳过——被静默丢弃的价格行会变成&quot;这个渠道为什么没价&quot;的线上事故。因此导入系统的核心产物不是&quot;写入成功&quot;，而是一份<strong>逐行的处置结果</strong>：哪些接受、哪些修正后接受、哪些拒收、拒收的原因是什么、由谁重送。</p>\n<p>这决定了导入校验的分层设计。校验不应是一段 <code>if</code> 堆叠，而是一条从语法到业务的漏斗：越靠前的层越廉价、越确定，越靠后的层越依赖领域知识。把便宜的检查放前面，是为了让昂贵的检查（查库、查规则、查冲突）只处理已经通过基本正确性的行，从而把批量导入的耗时压住。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[来源文件/批次] --&gt; B[L0 语法与编码]&#10;  B --&gt; C[L1 结构/schema]&#10;  C --&gt; D[L2 值域与类型]&#10;  D --&gt; E[L3 引用完整性]&#10;  E --&gt; F[L4 业务规则与冲突]&#10;  F --&gt; G{处置判定}&#10;  G --&gt;|通过| H[写入价格主表]&#10;  G --&gt;|可修正| I[修正后重入]&#10;  G --&gt;|拒收| J[隔离区 + 异常报告]&#10;  I --&gt; B\">graph TD\n  A[来源文件/批次] --&gt; B[L0 语法与编码]\n  B --&gt; C[L1 结构/schema]\n  C --&gt; D[L2 值域与类型]\n  D --&gt; E[L3 引用完整性]\n  E --&gt; F[L4 业务规则与冲突]\n  F --&gt; G{处置判定}\n  G --&gt;|通过| H[写入价格主表]\n  G --&gt;|可修正| I[修正后重入]\n  G --&gt;|拒收| J[隔离区 + 异常报告]\n  I --&gt; B</pre><h2 id=\"校验分层与职责\">校验分层与职责</h2><p>层级划分的判据是&quot;这一层需要什么才能判断&quot;。L0/L1 只看文件本身，L2 需要字段定义，L3 需要主数据索引，L4 需要业务规则库与同批次/在库数据的比对。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>判断依据</th>\n<th>典型例子</th>\n<th>失败处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L0</td>\n<td>语法与编码</td>\n<td>文件级</td>\n<td>UTF-8 非法字节、CSV 列数不齐、分隔符错乱</td>\n<td>整批拒收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L1</td>\n<td>结构/Schema</td>\n<td>列名与类型声明</td>\n<td>缺 <code>currency</code> 列、<code>price</code> 列含非数字</td>\n<td>整批拒收或按行拒收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2</td>\n<td>值域与类型</td>\n<td>字段定义</td>\n<td>币种非 ISO 4217、小数位超限、日期非法</td>\n<td>按行拒收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3</td>\n<td>引用完整性</td>\n<td>主数据索引</td>\n<td>GTIN 不存在、渠道码未注册、供应商未启用</td>\n<td>按行拒收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4</td>\n<td>业务规则与冲突</td>\n<td>规则库 + 库内/批内比对</td>\n<td>同渠道时段重叠、售价低于成本、MAP 违规</td>\n<td>按行拒收或警告</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>L0/L1 是整个文件的属性，一行坏了往往意味着文件本身被截断或编码损坏，这时按行拒收会掩盖问题，应当整批退回。L2 以下才是逐行判定——这是&quot;批量导入不该全量回滚&quot;原则的具体落点。</p>\n<p>冲突检测是 L4 里最贵的一项，因为它要知道&quot;这个价格与库里已有的和本批其他行是否打架&quot;。价格主数据的时间维度决定了冲突不是简单的等值比较，而是<strong>区间重叠</strong>：两条记录当且仅当渠道相同、价格类型相同、且生效区间有交集时才是冲突。给定记录 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 的生效区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[s_a, e_a]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 与记录 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[s_b, e_b]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，重叠条件为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(s_a \\le e_b) \\land (s_b \\le e_a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>区间端点约定为<strong>闭区间</strong>，且同一渠道同一价格类型的连续生效区间必须无缝衔接，否则中间会出现&quot;无价窗口&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"价格字段的特有校验\">价格字段的特有校验</h2><p>价格数据的校验比普通主数据多出几类专属规则，它们来自货币、标识与法规三个方向。</p>\n<p><strong>币种与小数位。</strong> 价格的存储精度由币种决定，不能一刀切两位小数。ISO 4217 为每个现行货币代码规定了 minor unit（小数位）：多数货币为 2 位（EUR、GBP、USD），JPY、KRW、VND 为 0 位，BHD、JOD、KWD、OMR 为 3 位，个别基金/指数单位可达 4 位。校验规则应为&quot;小数位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span></span></span></span></span> 该币种 minor unit&quot;，用整数分（minor unit 计数）存储以避免浮点误差（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_4217\">ISO 4217</a>）。校验前需要币种与单位已归一，换算的口径见 <a href=\"multi-currency-and-uom-price-conversion\">多币种与计量单位价格换算</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>商品标识。</strong> 若价格行以 GTIN 关联商品，需校验其格式与校验位。GTIN 有 8/12/13/14 四种长度，第 14 位为模 10 校验位，GTIN-14 的 T1 指示位取值 1–8 表示包装层级、9 表示变量计量商品，0 不合法（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Global_Trade_Item_Number\">GTIN</a>）。校验位算法为：从右向左交替乘 3 和 1，求和后取模。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c = \\bigl(10 - ((\\textstyle\\sum_i w_i d_i) \\bmod 10)\\bigr) \\bmod 10, \\quad w_i \\in \\{3,1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">((</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>导入时应把校验失败的行标为&quot;标识无效&quot;而非&quot;商品不存在&quot;——两者的处置人不同，前者要供应商修，后者可能是主数据同步延迟。</p>\n<p><strong>跨市场一致性与法规价。</strong> 渠道报价还必须与对外展示口径对齐。以 Google Merchant Center 为例，<code>price</code> 必须与落地页和结算页一致，不得按 IP 或位置变化，折扣价须人人可得且页面明示，会员价走 <code>loyalty_program</code> 而非 <code>price</code>，美加不得把销售税计入 <code>price</code>（多数其他国家则要求含 VAT/GST）。这类规则在导入时体现为&quot;渠道可见价与站点价偏差阈值&quot;和&quot;税含标志与市场匹配&quot;两条检查（<a href=\"https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/6324371\">Google Merchant Center price 规范</a>）。表里把价格规则编码为<strong>带来源依据的条目</strong>，来源栏为空则拒绝入库——一条说不出出处的价格规则不该存在于主数据里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"异常分类与处置策略\">异常分类与处置策略</h2><p>异常不是二元的&quot;好/坏&quot;。把每一行映射到固定的处置动作，才能让导入结果可预测、可自动化重放。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>异常类别</th>\n<th>判定</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n<th>是否阻断该行</th>\n<th>通知对象</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>格式错误</td>\n<td>L0/L1 失败</td>\n<td>整批退回</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>送数方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段非法</td>\n<td>L2 失败</td>\n<td>按行拒收</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>送数方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引用缺失</td>\n<td>L3 失败</td>\n<td>按行拒收 + 标记可重试</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>送数方/主数据负责人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区间冲突</td>\n<td>L4 重叠</td>\n<td>拒收并列出冲突行</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>定价负责人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>越界可疑</td>\n<td>偏差超阈值但合法</td>\n<td>警告 + 需人工确认</td>\n<td>否（暂挂）</td>\n<td>定价负责人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复行</td>\n<td>批内/库内主键重复</td>\n<td>幂等去重</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&quot;越界可疑&quot;这一类值得单独设计。售价从 9.99 跳到 999 语法完全合法、引用也存在，但它极可能是小数点错位。把它当作拒收会阻断真实调价，直接接受又会造成事故。正确做法是<strong>暂挂</strong>：写入临时区并生成待确认项，人工放行后才进入主表。判据用相对偏差或绝对阈值，例如当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\frac{p_{\\text{new}} - p_{\\text{old}}}{p_{\\text{old}}}| &gt; \\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3355em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8544em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 常取 0.5）时触发暂挂。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等-重试与批次一致性\">幂等、重试与批次一致性</h2><p>批量导入必须幂等：同一个批次重放两次，结果必须与一次相同。实现手段是给每批一个<strong>批次号</strong>，并让写入成为按业务主键的 upsert，而不是 append。业务主键通常由（渠道、价格类型、商品键、生效起始日）构成；同一主键重放即覆盖，不产生副本。</p>\n<p>分片导入时还要定义一致性边界。跨行没有内在依赖的批次可采用<strong>部分成功</strong>：通过的行立即入库，失败的行进入隔离区。但如果一批数据内部存在依赖（例如同一商品的多个层级价必须同时生效），则应把这组行当作一个一致性单元，整组原子提交，避免出现半套价格。</p>\n<p>重试的语义需要区分清楚：<strong>可重试</strong>（引用缺失，等主数据同步后重送即可）与<strong>不可重试</strong>（值域非法，必须改数）。报告里给每行标注这一点，重放器才能只挑选可重试行而不用全量重跑。超时也不等于未发生——重放前必须先按批次号查询该批是否已部分落库，否则会重复写入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"异常报告与闭环\">异常报告与闭环</h2><p>导入的最终交付物是<strong>异常报告</strong>，它要能让一个不看代码的人在三分钟内判断&quot;这批能不能用、谁该动手&quot;。报告应按处置类别分节，每行给出：行号、业务主键、失败层、失败原因码、期望值、实际值、可否重试、建议动作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;batch_id&quot;: &quot;PL-2026-10-01-SUP-4471&quot;,&#10;  &quot;source&quot;: &quot;SUPPLIER_CSV&quot;,&#10;  &quot;total_rows&quot;: 128400,&#10;  &quot;accepted&quot;: 127982,&#10;  &quot;repaired&quot;: 310,&#10;  &quot;rejected&quot;: 108,&#10;  &quot;suspended&quot;: 12,&#10;  &quot;rejects&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;row&quot;: 83921,&#10;      &quot;key&quot;: { &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;EU-DE-WEB&quot;, &quot;sku&quot;: &quot;A17-BLK-M&quot;, &quot;from&quot;: &quot;2026-10-05&quot; },&#10;      &quot;layer&quot;: &quot;L3&quot;,&#10;      &quot;code&quot;: &quot;GTIN_NOT_FOUND&quot;,&#10;      &quot;expected&quot;: &quot;existing GTIN&quot;,&#10;      &quot;actual&quot;: &quot;4006381333932&quot;,&#10;      &quot;retryable&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;action&quot;: &quot;等待商品主数据同步后重送&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"batch_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PL-2026-10-01-SUP-4471\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SUPPLIER_CSV\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"total_rows\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"accepted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">127982</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"repaired\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">310</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rejected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">108</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"suspended\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rejects\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"row\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">83921</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EU-DE-WEB\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A17-BLK-M\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-05\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"layer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"L3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GTIN_NOT_FOUND\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"expected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"existing GTIN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"actual\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"4006381333932\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"retryable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"等待商品主数据同步后重送\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>闭环的关键在于<strong>隔离区</strong>：被拒行连同原始内容一起落库，而不是随报告消失。有了隔离区，异常才有&quot;未处理/已重送/已放弃&quot;的状态流转，才能统计&quot;哪类异常反复出现&quot;并反向改进上游。若某类异常连续多个批次都出现，说明问题在上游送数方或校验规则本身，此时应调整规则，而不是继续人工清理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>导入校验把&quot;价格主数据&quot;从一张表变成一个受控入口，其要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>校验分层从廉价到昂贵（L0→L4），L0/L1 整批退回，L2 以下逐行判定，保住&quot;不全量回滚&quot;的批量语义。</li>\n<li>价格特有校验集中在币种 minor unit（ISO 4217）、GTIN 校验位、跨市场展示一致性与含税口径三类。</li>\n<li>冲突检测是区间重叠问题，闭区间重叠条件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(s_a \\le e_b) \\land (s_b \\le e_a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，连续区间不得留无价窗口。</li>\n<li>异常按处置动作分类，额外保留&quot;暂挂&quot;处理语法合法但数值可疑的调价。</li>\n<li>幂等靠批次号 + 按业务主键 upsert；重试要区分可重试与不可重试，并先查批次落库状态再重放。</li>\n<li>交付物是可处置的异常报告与隔离区，异常状态可流转、可统计，反复出现的异常反向驱动规则改进。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"主数据导入校验与异常处理","id":"主数据导入校验与异常处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"校验分层与职责","id":"校验分层与职责"},{"level":2,"text":"价格字段的特有校验","id":"价格字段的特有校验"},{"level":2,"text":"异常分类与处置策略","id":"异常分类与处置策略"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等、重试与批次一致性","id":"幂等-重试与批次一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"异常报告与闭环","id":"异常报告与闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多币种与计量单位价格换算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-channel-price-list-administration/price-list-masterdata/multi-currency-and-uom-price-conversion"},"next":{"title":"价格版本模型与快照","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-channel-price-list-administration/price-list-version-effective/price-list-versioning-and-snapshot"}}